@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@journeyId = {{createJourney.response.body.$.journeyId}}

### Create a journey (consent is required for outbound calls/messages)
# @name createJourney
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journeys
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userPhone": "+919999999999",
  "destinationLatitude": 37.7749,
  "destinationLongitude": -122.4194,
  "geofenceRadiusMeters": 250,
  "notificationConsent": true
}

### Record a location update near the destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journeys/{{journeyId}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 37.7750,
  "longitude": -122.4195,
  "timestamp": "2026-11-02T11:15:00Z"
}

### Get journey status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journeys/{{journeyId}}
Accept: application/json

### Twilio voice webhook (signature is disabled by default with fake providers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/voice?journeyId={{journeyId}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### Twilio Gather webhook: digit 1 accepts
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/gather?journeyId={{journeyId}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Digits=1&CallSid=CA124

### Twilio Gather webhook: digit 2 schedules a retry
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/gather?journeyId={{journeyId}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Digits=2&CallSid=CA00000000000000000000000000000002

### Twilio Gather webhook: digit 3 declines
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/gather?journeyId={{journeyId}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Digits=3&CallSid=CA00000000000000000000000000000003

### Twilio call status callback
# Use a CallSid assigned to an existing notification attempt.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/status
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

CallSid=CA00000000000000000000000000000001&CallStatus=completed

### Twilio message status callback
# Use a MessageSid assigned to an existing journey message.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/message-status
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

MessageSid=SM00000000000000000000000000000001&MessageStatus=delivered

### Twilio WhatsApp inbound webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/twilio/whatsapp/inbound
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

From=whatsapp%3A%2B14155550123&To=whatsapp%3A%2B14155550100&Body=Hello

### Run a scheduled retry task manually (internal endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tasks/journeys/{{journeyId}}/retry

### Run a message fallback task manually (internal endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tasks/journeys/{{journeyId}}/message-fallback
